<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 587-1 V INDIA AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 587-1 V INDIA AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 587-1 at close of play on the fourth day of the first match against India in Colombo on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 1st innings 537-8 declared; Sri Lanka 587-1 (Sanath Jayasuriya 326 not out, Roshan Mahanama 211 not out)</p>
